# fal.ai credentials for identity-preserving image generation.
# Without this set, the app runs in mock mode: generation is free and just
# echoes back the character's reference image, so you can develop/demo the
# whole flow before wiring up a real key.
# Get a key at https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys
FAL_KEY=

# Optional overrides:
# FAL_IMAGE_EDIT_MODEL=fal-ai/qwen-image-edit
# FAL_IMAGE_EDIT_COST_USD=0.06
